```

`FileStore` implements both interfaces and holds an in-memory buffer. A component writes through `IWriter`, another reads through `IReader`. Which statement is true?

In .NET 10 you register two caches and a consumer:

```csharp
services.AddKeyedSingleton<ICache, RedisCache>("distributed");
services.AddKeyedSingleton<ICache, MemoryCache>("local");
services.AddScoped<CatalogService>();

public sealed class CatalogService(ICache cache) { /* ... */ }
